  "comment": [
    "**The position of this engine in its field, on two axes at once: accuracy, and what accuracy costs.**",
    "Every competitor's score is somebody else's number, quoted with the source that published it, and **the only rows",
    "measured here are the ones whose `origin` says `measured`**. A figure this project did not measure is not a",
    "comparison - it is a citation - and the renderer draws them differently for exactly that reason.",
    "**The cost axis is mostly empty, and that is the finding rather than a defect of the chart.** Of the twenty-two rows",
    "on the Martian offline board, one publishes a token count for a review: this one. The others are drawn as bars in",
    "the right-hand panel, at their accuracy, with `tokensPerReview: null` - which is what 'we cannot price it' looks",
